<title>USA: AMEX to list MoneyGram options on April 10.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list MoneyGram options on April 10.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said it will list options on MoneyGram Payment Systems Inc shares on April 10.</p>
<p>The options will have initial strike prices of 7-1/2, 10 and 12-1/2, with expirations in May, June, July and October, the exchange said.  Position limits are 7,500 contracts.</p>
<p>Highland Securities Co will be the specialist unit on the AMEX floor.</p>
<p>Chicago Derivatives Desk ((312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
